#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:1
msgid "E0082"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:3
msgid "Warning name: `ambiguous_braces`"
msgstr "警告名称：`ambiguous_braces`"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:5
msgid ""
"An empty `{}` literal is ambiguous among an empty map, JSON object, "
"record, and block expression."
msgstr "空的 `{}` 字面量在空映射、JSON 对象、记录和块表达式之间存在歧义。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:8
msgid "Erroneous example"
msgstr "错误示例"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:10
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn empty_scores() -> Unit {\n"
"  let scores = {}\n"
"  scores.set(\"alice\", 1)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:14
msgid "Suggestion"
msgstr "修改建议"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:16
msgid ""
"Write the intended constructor explicitly. For an empty map, use "
"`Map([])`. Other alternatives include `Json::empty_object()`, "
"`TypeName::{}`, and `{ () }`."
msgstr ""
"请显式写出预期的构造形式。空映射使用 `Map([])`；其他形式包括 `Json::empty_object()`、`TypeName::{}`"
" 和 `{ () }`。"

#: ../../language/error_codes/E0082.md:19
msgid ""
"///|\n"
"pub fn empty_scores() -> Unit {\n"
"  let scores : Map[String, Int] = Map([])\n"
"  scores.set(\"alice\", 1)\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

